  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cefas - Increasing production capacity of lime in Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEFAS S.A. (&#x201c;CEFAS&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Company&#x201d;) is one of Argentina&apos;s leading lime producers for the industrial sector, with over 20 years of experience. CEFAS produces lime for the Argentine construction market and supplies the industrial sectors in Argentina, Chile, and Uruguay, serving major mining, steel, and paper companies.The transaction involves financing for CEFAS, a subsidiary of the Mexican lime producer Grupo Calidra, S.A. de C.V. (&#x201c;Calidra&#x201d;), which will be used to finance capital investments and permanent working capital at its existing plants in Argentina.</narrative>
  </description>
